  {
    "id": 4901700180010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "クッキー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040090080",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、いいな\r\nジンジャークッキーなんか、もろにクリスマスだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……俺は飴でどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "！\r\n金太郎あめの、クリスマスのやつとか！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに、特別感あるなぁそれ\r\nスーパーの大入りだと、雰囲気でないもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！\r\n特別なのがいいですー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "じゃあ、あたしは……チョコです！\r\nちょっと高いやつ……っ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この前お兄ちゃんがひとつくれたんです\r\n『これはばくばく食べるものじゃないんだぞ』って！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー……うん、いくつか心当たりがある\r\nそれも探してみようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "やったー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あとは……\r\nそうだなぁ、ここまで分けやすいものだったから──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0648",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ケーキとかどうだ？\r\n普通のケーキは日持ちしないから、パウンドケーキとか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ケーキ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nあたし、クリスマスのケーキで食べたいのあります！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この間ちょこ先輩が言ってて……\r\nなんか難しい、カタカナのやつ…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "カタカナの難しい名前のクリスマスのケーキ？\r\n……なんだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと待ってくれ、考えてみるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……意図せず、ここでもクイズになっちゃったな！\r\n誰の飾りか当てた時のご褒美探しだったのに",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "！！　ほんとだ！！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170018/4901700180100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700180110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "じゃあ、クイズの答えがわかったら、\r\nこの問題のごほうびも考えないといけません！！",
